Aurora Download Manager — third-party native components

This project builds entirely from FLOSS components. The native libraries that
ship inside the APK and their licenses:

- libtorrent_flutter 1.9.2 (GPL-3.0) — BitTorrent engine. The 16 KB page-size
  aligned prebuilt used by the release build is vendored under
  tooling/torrent_16k/ (stamped with the source package version in
  tooling/torrent_16k/VERSION). Build with
  -PlibtorrentFlutterSkipDownload=true so the vendored prebuilt is used
  instead of the plugin's download/CMake fallback.
- ffmpeg-kit-min-gpl (GPL-3.0, with FFmpeg's LGPL components) — media
  transcoding. Resolved from Maven Central (com.antonkarpenko) at build time;
  the local fork packages/ffmpeg_kit_flutter_new_min_gpl carries its own
  LICENSE file.
- media_kit native libs (media_kit_libs_android_video, vendored fork under
  packages/ with its own LICENSE file) — libmpv based video playback.
- libaurora_adblock — this project's own native C++ adblock engine (domain
  trie + Aho-Corasick), built from source in this repository.

All other dependencies are Dart/Flutter packages declared in pubspec.yaml and
resolved from pub.dev at build time. The app itself is GPL-3.0-only; see the
top-level LICENSE file.
